# Unicode CLDR, cldr-dates-full/main/th/ca-gregorian.json, days.format.abbreviated.
# The prefixless form. Bound only where a marker or a date frames it:
# จันทร์ is equally the moon and อาทิตย์ equally the week, so a bare one
# names no day. CLDR's own relative-time data writes จันทร์ที่แล้ว for
# "last Monday", which is why the short form must read at all.
พฤหัส
